{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","守望之环"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","佐尔娅周期性地在休眠状态和苏醒状态中切换，每次苏醒时降临在敌人附近造成伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，佐尔娅的各项技能威力强大且冷却时间较短，但仅在自身苏醒期间可以使用。进入战斗时自身处于休眠状态，休眠期间处于无敌，且每秒恢复85点能量值和7%最大生命值。能量满时，佐尔娅会苏醒并参与战斗，期间自身处于稳定，每秒消耗70点能量值。在能量值耗尽后会再次休眠。除本技能以外的其他来源的能量增减效果不会影响佐尔娅的能量，但每10点其他来源的能量恢复永久增加自身1%攻击力，最多叠加100层。每次佐尔娅苏醒时，会降临在敌方最密集区域，并对周围2格范围内的敌人造成300% + 4% ATK伤害和2秒眩晕。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":234,"end":239,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":58,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"},{"start":104,"end":106,"tooltip_key":"keyword:stable"},{"start":230,"end":243,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","佐尔娅降临时的伤害提升至320% + 4% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","佐尔娅降临时的伤害提升至340% + 4% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","佐尔娅降临时的伤害提升至360% + 4% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","佐尔娅降临时的伤害提升至380% + 4% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","石像壁垒"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","佐尔娅苏醒时受到伤害降低。主动释放时，对面前敌人造成伤害并击倒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，佐尔娅苏醒时会激活石化皮肤，使自身受到所有伤害降低70%，此效果会在后续10秒内逐渐减弱消失。主动释放时，拟化巨翅虚影，对前方2格扇形范围内的敌方目标造成270% + 30% ATK伤害并将其击倒2秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":85,"end":91,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":81,"end":95,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时的伤害提高至280% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时的伤害提高至290% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时的伤害提高至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","噬体打击"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","佐尔娅苏醒时获得生命汲取。主动释放时，对附近敌人造成多次伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，佐尔娅苏醒期间获得嗜血，使自身提高20点生命汲取，每当一名敌方英雄在自身2格范围内被击败，自身立即恢复30%最大生命值。主动释放时，对周身2格范围内的所有敌人造成2次85% + 10% ATK伤害，随后对范围内目标进行震慑攻击，造成1次250% + 30% ATK的伤害并附带目标已损生命值15%的额外伤害，最高不超过150% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":90,"end":96,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":126,"end":132,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":87,"end":100,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":122,"end":136,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":163,"end":171,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时的2次伤害提高至90% + 10% ATK，震慑攻击的基础伤害提高至260% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":39,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时的2次伤害提高至95% + 10% ATK，震慑攻击的基础伤害提高至270% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":43,"end":49,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":39,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时的2次伤害提高至100% + 10% ATK，震慑攻击的基础伤害提高至280% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":44,"end":50,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":40,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","造成伤害提升，附近敌人不少于2名时造成伤害额外提升。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身造成伤害提升9%。自身周围2格内的敌人数量不少于2人时，造成伤害额外提升3%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身造成伤害提升12%。自身周围2格内的敌人数量不少于2人时，造成伤害额外提升4%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身造成伤害提升15%。自身周围2格内的敌人数量不少于2人时，造成伤害额外提升5%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","震慑力场"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","佐尔娅苏醒期间激活镇守力场，降低敌人的移速和急速，并为自身提高高额急速。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","佐尔娅苏醒期间，会激活周身2格半径的镇守力场，使其中的所有敌人降低80%的移动速度和60点急速，并使自身的急速提高20点。其他友方英雄每次释放终极技能时，都将使镇守力场的急速加成永久提高15点，最多叠加4次。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","镇守力场提供的急速提高至30点。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","自身生命值比例不低于50%时，佐尔娅始终处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","镇守力场提供的急速提高至40点。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","佐尔娅受到最后一击时免于被击败，直接进入休眠状态。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当佐尔娅遭受最后一击时，将会耗尽精神力免于被击败，立即进入休眠状态。该效果每场战斗只能触发一次。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":10,"tooltip_key":"keyword:fatal"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","灵灯石翼"]]}